      "description": "Creates a new meeting in Fireflies for transcription (requires a publicly accessible URL).",
      "id": "upload_audio",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "description": "The publicly accessible HTTPS URL of your audio or video file (mp3, mp4, wav, m4a, ogg). Fireflies only accepts URLs, not direct file uploads. For private files, use a signed URL with a short expiry.",
